[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3066715900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108560#issuecomment-3066715900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108560","id":3066715900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62yl78","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T08:23:00Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T08:23:00Z","body":"Is the goal for this change to be faster? Have you measured a performance increase in a large scene?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3066715900/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067189303","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108560#issuecomment-3067189303","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108560","id":3067189303,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc620Zg3","user":{"login":"dementive","id":87823030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3ODIzMDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87823030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive","html_url":"https://github.com/dementive","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T17:42:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T17:48:25Z","body":"> Is the goal for this change to be faster? Have you measured a performance increase in a large scene?\r\n\r\nI just ran a benchmark and it does seem to be faster. At first I tried to do a micro benchmark and just time it but this didn't tell me anything meaningful. Then I tried valgrind with cachegrind and callgrind, that also didn't really tell me anything useful other than that the flush transform function does get called millions of times per minute. Finally I tried perf and looked at it in hotspot and this did show the results I expected.\r\n\r\nSo what I did to benchmark it was:\r\n\r\n1. Compiled binaries with and without the changes using `scons linker=mold debug_symbols=yes`.\r\n\r\n2. Modify the 3D platformer demo project to have 512 enemies that move around every frame instead of the default 4.\r\n\r\n3. I then ran 4 different runs of perf to compare the difference in how the changes effected the `flush_transform_notifications` function:\r\n\r\n- `timeout 1m perf record --call-graph dwarf path/to/main/branch/binary/godot game.tscn`\r\n- `timeout 3m perf record --call-graph dwarf path/to/main/branch/binary/godot game.tscn`\r\n\r\n\r\n- `timeout 1m perf record --call-graph dwarf path/to/my/branch/binary/godot game.tscn`\r\n- `timeout 3m perf record --call-graph dwarf path/to/my/branch/binary/godot game.tscn`\r\n\r\nThese are the results hot spot showed me:\r\n\r\n#### 1 minute run\r\n\r\nold:  <img width=\"1889\" height=\"300\" alt=\"old1m\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a4c9eaf-fee5-4ae2-9a9d-37af1e4b8839\" />\r\n\r\nnew: \r\n<img width=\"1889\" height=\"300\" alt=\"new1m\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b89b358-361b-4716-9aaf-c86597ae244b\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n#### 3 minute run\r\n\r\nold:  <img width=\"1889\" height=\"300\" alt=\"old3m\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10407b17-853a-41ae-a375-451fa86a6077\" />\r\n\r\nnew: <img width=\"1889\" height=\"300\" alt=\"new3m\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b430225-c5b7-40cb-8121-487e0a707e21\" />\r\n\r\nSo I think these results show that these changes do what I was aiming for. Running for 1 minute it was faster than before and as time goes on the performance difference between them gets bigger because the function gets called 8 times every frame.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067189303/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067398952","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108560#issuecomment-3067398952","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108560","id":3067398952,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc621Mso","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T23:42:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T23:42:09Z","body":"Very nice! That's a pretty consistent improvement then","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067398952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3068888708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108560#issuecomment-3068888708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108560","id":3068888708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6264aE","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-14T10:35:54Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T10:36:59Z","body":"One thing that should be mentioned is that `LocalVector` will not shrink back down by itself. If during any frame there are 10k xforms in the change list, the `xform_change_list` vector will have a size of at least ~10k elements (80kb) for the remainder of the session, no matter how small future change lists are. I think this is acceptable, but it should be factored into the decision.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3068888708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3069936103","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108560#issuecomment-3069936103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108560","id":3069936103,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62-4Hn","user":{"login":"dementive","id":87823030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3ODIzMDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87823030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive","html_url":"https://github.com/dementive","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-14T15:02:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T15:02:17Z","body":"> One thing that should be mentioned is that `LocalVector` will not shrink back down by itself. If during any frame there are 10k xforms in the change list, the `xform_change_list` vector will have a size of at least ~10k elements (80kb) for the remainder of the session, no matter how small future change lists are. I think this is acceptable, but it should be factored into the decision.\n\n\nGood point didn't think of that. Like you say I think this still ends up working though and if is a problem can change it to use LocalVector::reset instead of clear. Resetting would make it behave the exact same as the list but it would also make it so there are a lot more dynamic memory allocations when nodes get added so keeping the extra memory here isn't so bad.\n\nI think overall this new way ends up using less memory too because of the changes to the SelfList being stored in the nodes to a bool. That saved 31 bytes per node  so for 10k nodes that would be 302kb less than before.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3069936103/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]